{
  "info": {
    "name": "Vela Sync Server",
    "_postman_id": "vela-sync-server-v1",
    "description": "API del servidor de sincronización de Vela Browser.\n\nFlujo de autenticación:\n1. POST /auth/magic-link → recibes el email con el token\n2. GET /auth/verify?token=XXX → el servidor crea la sesión y redirige a vela://sync-callback?token=YYY\n3. Copia el `token` de la URL de callback y ponlo en la variable de colección `session_token`\n4. Ya puedes usar todos los endpoints de /sync",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "base_url",
      "value": "https://sync.vela-browser.com",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "session_token",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Token de sesión obtenido tras verificar el magic link. Ponlo aquí tras completar el flujo de auth."
    },
    {
      "key": "profile_id",
      "value": "my-profile-uuid",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "workspace_id",
      "value": "my-workspace-uuid",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{session_token}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Health",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET /health",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/health",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["health"]
            }
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "OK",
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "body": "{\n  \"status\": \"ok\",\n  \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n  \"uptime\": 42.3\n}"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Auth — Magic Link",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "1. Solicitar magic link",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/auth/magic-link",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "magic-link"]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"tu@email.com\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "description": "Envía un email con el magic link al usuario. Rate limitado.\n\nEl email contiene una URL del tipo:\nhttps://sync.vela-browser.com/auth/verify?token=XXXX"
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "Email enviado",
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "body": "{\n  \"ok\": true,\n  \"message\": \"Email enviado. Revisa tu bandeja.\"\n}"
            },
            {
              "name": "Email inválido",
              "status": "Bad Request",
              "code": 400,
              "body": "{\n  \"ok\": false,\n  \"error\": \"Email inválido\"\n}"
            },
            {
              "name": "Rate limit",
              "status": "Too Many Requests",
              "code": 429,
              "body": "{\n  \"ok\": false,\n  \"error\": \"Too many requests\"\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "2. Verificar token (desde email)",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/auth/verify?token=PEGA_AQUI_EL_TOKEN_DEL_EMAIL",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "verify"],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "PEGA_AQUI_EL_TOKEN_DEL_EMAIL",
                  "description": "Token de 32 chars recibido en el email. Válido 15 minutos, uso único."
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Valida el magic link token.\n\nEn el navegador: redirige a `vela://sync-callback?token=SESSION_TOKEN`\nEn Postman: recibirás un 3xx. El session token está en la URL de la cabecera Location.\n\nCopia el valor del parámetro `token` de esa URL y ponlo en la variable `session_token` de la colección."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "Redirect a vela://",
              "status": "Found",
              "code": 302,
              "header": [
                {
                  "key": "Location",
                  "value": "vela://sync-callback?token=SESSION_TOKEN_AQUI"
                }
              ],
              "body": ""
            },
            {
              "name": "Token inválido o expirado",
              "status": "Bad Request",
              "code": 400,
              "body": "{\n  \"ok\": false,\n  \"error\": \"Token inválido o expirado\"\n}"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Sync — Profiles",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET /sync/profiles",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/sync/profiles",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["sync", "profiles"]
            }
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "OK",
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "body": "{\n  \"profiles\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"uuid-del-perfil\",\n      \"name_ct\": \"<dato cifrado>\",\n      \"updated_at\": 1716000000000\n    }\n  ]\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "POST /sync/profiles",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/sync/profiles",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["sync", "profiles"]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"id\": \"{{profile_id}}\",\n  \"name_ct\": \"<nombre cifrado con clave del perfil>\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            }
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "OK",
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "body": "{\n  \"ok\": true\n}"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Sync — Entities",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET /sync/entities",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/sync/entities?profile_id={{profile_id}}&since_seq=0",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["sync", "entities"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "profile_id", "value": "{{profile_id}}" },
                { "key": "since_seq", "value": "0", "description": "Devuelve solo entidades con server_seq > este valor. Usar 0 para sync inicial." }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Máximo 1000 entidades por petición. Paginar incrementando `since_seq` con el `current_seq` de la respuesta anterior."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "OK",
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "body": "{\n  \"entities\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"uuid-entidad\",\n      \"entity_type\": \"tab\",\n      \"data_ct\": \"<datos cifrados>\",\n      \"updated_at\": 1716000000000,\n      \"deleted\": 0,\n      \"server_seq\": 42\n    }\n  ],\n  \"current_seq\": 42\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "PUT /sync/entities",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/sync/entities",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["sync", "entities"]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"profile_id\": \"{{profile_id}}\",\n  \"entities\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"uuid-entidad\",\n      \"entity_type\": \"tab\",\n      \"data_ct\": \"<datos cifrados>\",\n      \"updated_at\": 1716000000000,\n      \"deleted\": false\n    }\n  ]\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "description": "Upsert de entidades. Resolución de conflictos: gana el `updated_at` más reciente (last-write-wins). Notifica a otros peers conectados por WebSocket."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "OK",
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "body": "{\n  \"ok\": true,\n  \"server_seq\": 43\n}"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Sync — Y.Docs",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET /sync/ydocs/:workspace_id",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/sync/ydocs/{{workspace_id}}?profile_id={{profile_id}}",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["sync", "ydocs", "{{workspace_id}}"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "profile_id", "value": "{{profile_id}}" }
              ]
            }
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "OK",
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "body": "{\n  \"doc_ct\": \"<Y.js state cifrado en base64>\",\n  \"server_seq\": 10,\n  \"updated_at\": 1716000000000\n}"
            },
            {
              "name": "No encontrado",
              "status": "Not Found",
              "code": 404,
              "body": "{\n  \"ok\": false,\n  \"error\": \"Not found\"\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "PUT /sync/ydocs/:workspace_id",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/sync/ydocs/{{workspace_id}}",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["sync", "ydocs", "{{workspace_id}}"]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"profile_id\": \"{{profile_id}}\",\n  \"doc_ct\": \"<Y.js state cifrado>\",\n  \"updated_at\": 1716000000000\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            }
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "OK",
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "body": "{\n  \"ok\": true,\n  \"server_seq\": 11\n}"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Sync — Vault",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET /sync/vault",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/sync/vault?profile_id={{profile_id}}",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["sync", "vault"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "profile_id", "value": "{{profile_id}}" }
              ]
            }
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "OK",
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "body": "{\n  \"vault_ct\": \"<vault cifrado en base64>\",\n  \"server_seq\": 5,\n  \"updated_at\": 1716000000000\n}"
            },
            {
              "name": "No encontrado",
              "status": "Not Found",
              "code": 404,
              "body": "{\n  \"ok\": false,\n  \"error\": \"Not found\"\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "PUT /sync/vault",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/sync/vault",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["sync", "vault"]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"profile_id\": \"{{profile_id}}\",\n  \"vault_ct\": \"<vault cifrado>\",\n  \"updated_at\": 1716000000000\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            }
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "OK",
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "body": "{\n  \"ok\": true,\n  \"server_seq\": 6\n}"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Sync — Devices / Session",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET /sync/devices",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/sync/devices",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["sync", "devices"]
            },
            "description": "Lista todos los dispositivos activos del usuario (sesiones no expiradas)."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "OK",
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "body": "{\n  \"devices\": [\n    {\n      \"token_suffix\": \"abcd1234\",\n      \"device_name\": \"Vela — Windows\",\n      \"created_at\": 1716000000000,\n      \"last_used_at\": 1716050000000\n    }\n  ]\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "DELETE /sync/devices/:suffix",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/sync/devices/abcd1234",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["sync", "devices", "abcd1234"]
            },
            "description": "Revoca la sesión de un dispositivo concreto por su token_suffix (últimos 8 chars del token)."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "OK",
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "body": "{\n  \"ok\": true\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "DELETE /sync/session (logout)",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/sync/session",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["sync", "session"]
            },
            "description": "Cierra sesión del dispositivo actual (revoca el token Bearer usado en esta petición)."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "OK",
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "body": "{\n  \"ok\": true\n}"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
